LAMMPS (30 Mar 2026 - Development - patch_30Mar2026-102-g7e52522855)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
### Initialization ###
units si
atom_style molecular
dimension 3
boundary p p p
newton on
#package omp 8
#suffix omp

### System: rigid H2 state pre-generated by gen_h2_init.py ###
read_data h2_init.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (1e-07 1e-07 1e-07)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  40000 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  40000 velocities
  scanning bonds ...
  1 = max bonds/atom
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (1e-07 1e-07 1e-07)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading bonds ...
  20000 bonds
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     1 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     0 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
     0 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
     1 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.006 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.334 seconds

### Force field ###
pair_style lj/cut 1.0e-9
pair_coeff 1 1 1.056e-21 2.827e-10
special_bonds lj 0.0 0.0 0.0
bond_style zero
bond_coeff 1 7.4e-11

### Group + per-molecule chunk ###
group h2gas type 1
40000 atoms in group h2gas
compute molchunk h2gas chunk/atom molecule

compute Trot h2gas temp/chunk molchunk com yes adof 1.0 cdof 0.0

# Whole-system kinetic temperature (compute temp accounts for rigid DOF).
compute Ttot all temp

# Decompose:  T_tot = (3 T_trans + 2 T_rot) / 5   =>   T_trans = (5 T_tot - 2 T_rot) / 3
variable Ttrans equal (5*c_Ttot-2*c_Trot)/3

### Neighbor list ###
# Skin must be small compared to the box (here 100 nm). At very large boxes
# (>>1 micron) a larger skin is faster, but at this scale 2 Angstroms is the
# right order of magnitude.
neighbor     1.0e-10 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 20 check yes
atom_modify  sort 100 0.0

### Time integration ###
# rigid H2 (no vibration)
fix myintegrator all rigid/small molecule
Fix rigid/small setup ...
  create bodies CPU = 0.014 seconds
  20000 rigid bodies with 40000 atoms
  7.4000014e-11 = max distance from body owner to body atom

### Output ###
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step v_Ttrans c_Trot c_Ttot ke etotal
thermo_modify lost warn
fix dumpinfo all print 1000 "$(step) $(time) $(v_Ttrans) $(c_Trot)" file output/lammps_H2_energy_relaxation.dat screen no title "timestep simtime Ttrans Trot"

### Run ###
timestep 1.0e-15
run      1000000
